          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wakasondamisha mali kudi kazweŋi kawantu ami iwudi nawu, bayi wakamwila neyi wumukwakuso ndamishaku; bayi wakamudi ilanŋala nyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi ifuku dimu wakakwatila chuma chamu kwenu chakuvwala, wakamufuntishili chu neyi itaŋwa dichidi kanda diholoki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa chuma chindi chakudibuta nachu choche nochu hohu, dichichuma chindi chakuvwala chahekowa dindi; ochu wakakama nanka? Chamba kela, chakandililayi, ami nakatiya, muloŋa ami ni kweti luwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
